WEBVTT

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:36.850 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:39.940 line:0%
[Episode 36]

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:45.559 line:0%
Lord Geng,

00:01:45.559 --> 00:01:46.760 line:0%
that villain Lai is becoming

00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:48.040 line:0%
more and more lawless.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:50.160 line:0%
We need to come up with a plan.

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:53.160 line:0%
Lord Geng?

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:08.430 line:0%
Lord Geng, those who steal a hook are executed,

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:10.960 line:0%
while those who steal a kingdom become lords!

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:18.640 line:0%
Huan,

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:24.420 line:0%
do you hate me?

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:29.570 line:0%
Is that why you torment me with nightmares every night?

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:33.050 line:0%
Do you,

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:36.050 line:0%
like those old ministers,

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:38.240 line:0%
also believe that I am

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:43.470 line:0%
overstepping my place by ruling the court?

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:56.920 line:0%
Huan,

00:03:58.600 --> 00:03:59.910 line:0%
Qi...

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:04.180 line:0%
still refuses to speak.

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:08.970 line:0%
Xichen and Nanlang are eyeing us like hungry wolves.

00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:11.050 line:0%
I am holding up

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:14.410 line:0%
the entire Cang State dynasty on my own.

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:18.639 line:0%
Tell me, how have I wronged you?

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:29.600 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:33.080 line:0%
the court is unstable right now.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:35.080 line:0%
You should take care of your health.

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:38.770 line:0%
It's alright.

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:45.080 line:0%
The state preceptor has passed away,

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:49.820 line:0%
and with internal strife and external threats,

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:52.520 line:0%
I can't help but feel troubled.

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:59.290 line:0%
As for the affairs of the court,

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:01.450 line:0%
have they been properly arranged?

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:02.820 line:0%
As per your decree,

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:04.200 line:0%
Lord Lai has been assigned

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:05.640 line:0%
to assist in state affairs.

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:07.000 line:0%
Lord Lai has submitted a memorial,

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.480 line:0%
advising you not to worry about the court

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:10.140 line:0%
and to focus on your recovery.

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:11.040 line:0%
Alright.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.480 line:0%
I still remember

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:17.040 line:0%
how the state preceptor devoted himself tirelessly,

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:19.190 line:0%
making predictions for Cang State

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:22.360 line:0%
until his very last breath.

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:29.610 line:0%
I only hope

00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:35.680 line:0%
that Cang State's fate

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:40.840 line:0%
will unfold as he foretold—

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:43.850 line:0%
with peace throughout the land.

00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:08.040 line:0%
[Lu's Pawnshop]

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:09.300 line:0%
Let's go, let's go!

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:12.280 line:0%
Qi Yeyun! Qi Yeyun!

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:13.130 line:0%
[Lu's Pawnshop]

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:13.610 line:0%
-Come out now!
-Coming!

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:15.240 line:0%
-What's wrong, sir?
-Hurry up and close the shop.

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:16.760 line:0%
Why are we closing the shop in broad daylight?

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:18.120 line:0%
Have you been staying at home all day

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:19.520 line:0%
without hearing anything?

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:21.360 line:0%
Something terrible has happened.

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.920 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager is gravely ill,

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:25.230 line:0%
[Lu's Pawnshop]

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:26.240 line:0%
and the Black Rakshasa is in power. The world is about to change.

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:27.040 line:0%
I heard that

00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:27.920 line:0%
several loyal ministers

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:29.120 line:0%
who opposed Lai Luozhi

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:30.440 line:0%
have been assassinated.

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:31.600 line:0%
In such times,

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:33.200 line:0%
how can we keep the shop open?

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:34.440 line:0%
The court and the country are in turmoil.

00:06:34.440 --> 00:06:34.920 line:0%
Isn't that exactly

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:36.920 line:0%
the business opportunity for pawnshops?

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:37.920 line:0%
You're being foolish!

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:38.720 line:0%
Let me ask you,

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:41.080 line:0%
which is more important, money or your life?

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:41.800 line:0%
Hurry up,

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:42.800 line:0%
close the shop.

00:06:42.959 --> 00:06:50.209 line:0%
[Lu's Pawnshop]

00:07:12.520 --> 00:07:13.520 line:0%
Lord Lai, you came to the Imperial Security Bureau

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:14.650 line:0%
with such a display.

00:07:15.970 --> 00:07:17.170 line:0%
What do you want?

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.240 line:0%
The Jin family is currently

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:20.640 line:0%
in custody at theImperial Security Bureau,

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:22.520 line:0%
yet their case is still pending.

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.680 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen, do you think

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:26.360 line:0%
that the Grand Empress Dowager's serious illness

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:28.040 line:0%
is an excuse for your dereliction

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:29.040 line:0%
of duty?

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:31.040 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:32.240 line:0%
needs more evidence.

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:36.680 line:0%
[Royal Guard Hall]

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:34.959 line:0%
Evidence?

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:37.530 line:0%
What I've brought here today is evidence.

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:40.050 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen,

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:42.730 line:0%
please start the trial and give a verdict now.

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:53.790 line:0%
How could I pass a judgment based on

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:55.730 line:0%
just one side's word?

00:07:55.959 --> 00:07:57.360 line:0%
You won't give a verdict?

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:58.800 line:0%
Fine.

00:07:59.480 --> 00:08:00.560 line:0%
I will.

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:01.440 line:0%
Lai Luozhi,

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:03.400 line:0%
are you openly disrespecting

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:04.930 line:0%
the authority of the court?

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:06.400 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau's affairs are not for

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:08.120 line:0%
the Imperial Investigation Department, which holds the same rank,

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:09.400 line:0%
to meddle in.

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:14.880 line:0%
[Devoted to Duty]

00:08:11.730 --> 00:08:14.160 line:0%
The Imperial Investigation Department can't meddle in it,

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:15.760 line:0%
but I, Lai Luozhi, can.

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:16.880 line:0%
Don't forget,

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:18.400 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager granted me the power

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:21.000 line:0%
to reward and punish the officials as I see fit.

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:23.410 line:0%
Imperial Guards!

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:24.440 line:0%
[Devoted to Duty]

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:24.800 line:0%
Shen Du of the Imperial Security Bureau,

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:25.700 line:0%
[Royal Guard Hall]

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:26.040 line:0%
for dereliction of duty

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:27.600 line:0%
and negligence

00:08:27.620 --> 00:08:29.010 line:0%
during the Grand Empress Dowager's illness,

00:08:27.850 --> 00:08:29.020 line:0%
[Devoted to Duty]

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:30.900 line:0%
is hereby detained for trial!

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:39.880 line:0%
What?

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:42.520 line:0%
You dare defy the Imperial Guards?

00:08:43.070 --> 00:08:45.800 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen, are you planning to rebel?

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:00.450 line:0%
If you kill the head of the Imperial Guards,

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:04.280 line:0%
I will charge you with treason

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:05.880 line:0%
and have everyone in the Imperial Security Bureau

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:07.120 line:0%
executed!

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:08.200 line:0%
Who dares?

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:23.320 line:0%
Lai Luozhi,

00:09:25.320 --> 00:09:26.440 line:0%
you actually deployed

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:29.300 line:0%
the Imperial Guards' Iron Crossbow Division here?

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:32.680 line:0%
That's because the Imperial Guards

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:36.140 line:0%
are more aware of the times than the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:09:36.560 --> 00:09:39.750 line:0%
Those in the Imperial Security Bureau who refuse to comply

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:41.360 line:0%
will be executed on the spot!

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:05.160 line:0%
Put down your swords!

00:10:09.650 --> 00:10:10.570 line:0%
This way,

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:13.860 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:10:58.320 --> 00:11:00.480 line:0%
My Lord, My Lord.

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:02.760 line:0%
Bad news. Something big has happened!

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:03.760 line:0%
Lord Lai brought the Imperial Guards

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:06.360 line:0%
and surrounded the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:07.360 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:08.840 line:0%
and everyone in the Imperial Security Bureau

00:11:08.840 --> 00:11:09.600 line:0%
have been imprisoned

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:10.840 line:0%
in the Imperial Investigation Department's prison.

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:12.160 line:0%
Lai Luozhi really

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:13.360 line:0%
made a move against Grand Commander Shen?

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:14.120 line:0%
Really.

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:15.160 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau and the Imperial Investigation Department

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:16.440 line:0%
have always been mortal enemies.

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.100 line:0%
Given Lord Lai's usual ways,

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:19.160 line:0%
he must be itching

00:11:19.160 --> 00:11:20.400 line:0%
to exterminate everyone in the Imperial Security Bureau

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:21.360 line:0%
and their entire families

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:22.440 line:0%
to vent his anger.

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:28.780 line:0%
Guards!

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:30.440 line:0%
Wu Taiming,

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:31.580 line:0%
what are you doing?

00:11:31.680 --> 00:11:33.410 line:0%
Are you going to hand over Xing?

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:36.180 line:0%
Grab your weapons!

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:37.240 line:0%
Yes!

00:11:43.120 --> 00:11:43.920 line:0%
Feng Gui.

00:11:47.480 --> 00:11:48.440 line:0%
Bring me the appointment decree

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:49.720 line:0%
from the Grand Empress Dowager

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:51.080 line:0%
for Director Yan and me.

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:57.080 line:0%
If Lai dares to take her,

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:58.800 line:0%
I will tell him

00:11:58.800 --> 00:11:59.530 line:0%
that Yan Xing

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:00.720 line:0%
is not only the wife of the Grand Commander

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:02.020 line:0%
of the Imperial Security Bureau

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:04.000 line:0%
but also a junior sixth-rank female director

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:05.880 line:0%
of the Ministry of Justice,

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:08.690 line:0%
appointed by the Grand Empress Dowager herself.

00:12:09.210 --> 00:12:10.220 line:0%
Come with me!

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:13.050 line:0%
Block the gate of the Ministry of Justice!

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:36.520 line:0%
[Just Rewards and Punishments]

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:33.880 line:0%
My Lord, My Lord.

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:35.360 line:0%
It's been so long,

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:36.200 line:0%
and the people from the Imperial Investigation Department

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:37.040 line:0%
are not here yet.

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:38.320 line:0%
How many times have I told you?

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:39.480 line:0%
Don't let your guard down!

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:40.940 line:0%
Never let your guard down!

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:44.030 line:0%
Stay on watch.

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:46.500 line:0%
But they haven't come, have they?

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:47.440 line:0%
Alright.

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:57.800 line:0%
Who is it?

00:12:58.350 --> 00:12:59.590 line:0%
Madam!

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:00.880 line:0%
Xing!

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:02.710 line:0%
I'm your brother.

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:03.800 line:0%
-Xing!
-Mojie?

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:04.890 line:0%
Madam!

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:06.160 line:0%
-Xing!
-Uncle Zhong?

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:07.800 line:0%
Open the gate.

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:16.760 line:0%
Mojie.

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:17.520 line:0%
Madam.

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:18.560 line:0%
Uncle Zhong.

00:13:18.720 --> 00:13:20.600 line:0%
Your father asked me to take you back to Yan's Mansion.

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:22.200 line:0%
Our family will protect you.

00:13:25.440 --> 00:13:26.240 line:0%
Mojie,

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:28.370 line:0%
thank you for your kindness.

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:29.920 line:0%
Uncle Zhong,

00:13:30.440 --> 00:13:31.240 line:0%
today,

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:33.490 line:0%
I will still return to Shen's Mansion.

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:34.560 line:0%
Madam.

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:47.760 line:0%
This way.

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:04.280 line:0%
Colleagues,

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:06.940 line:0%
I, Yan Xing, sincerely thank you.

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:25.600 line:0%
This way, Madam.

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:54.180 line:0%
Is this really the once-mighty

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:55.600 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen?

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:05.110 line:0%
I can hardly recognize you.

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:15.780 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:15:20.800 --> 00:15:23.040 line:0%
You truly are not very smart.

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:28.240 line:0%
Your mouth is really tough, isn't it?

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:30.800 line:0%
But in the Imperial Investigation Department,

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:32.160 line:0%
what kind of iron-willed man

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:33.560 line:0%
haven't we seen?

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:36.040 line:0%
After a few rounds of interrogation,

00:15:36.150 --> 00:15:38.060 line:0%
if one still refuses to speak,

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:41.280 line:0%
the only thing left for them is to beg for death.

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:45.560 line:0%
Yet you still can glare at me

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:47.440 line:0%
like that.

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:49.200 line:0%
I suppose I wasn't wrong

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:50.650 line:0%
to consider you my rival

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:53.380 line:0%
all these years.

00:15:57.330 --> 00:16:00.090 line:0%
The interrogation tools in the Imperial Investigation Department

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:02.020 line:0%
truly live up to their reputation.

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:05.010 line:0%
I can say I've experienced them

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:08.320 line:0%
firsthand in this lifetime.

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:10.640 line:0%
You're so capable.

00:16:11.510 --> 00:16:13.310 line:0%
If you were to die just like this,

00:16:14.090 --> 00:16:15.350 line:0%
wouldn't it be a waste?

00:16:23.640 --> 00:16:25.630 line:0%
People call you White Ghost

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:27.490 line:0%
and me Black Rakshasa.

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:30.240 line:0%
If we join forces—

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:32.000 line:0%
White Ghost and Black Rakshasa working together—

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:33.080 line:0%
who in this world

00:16:35.440 --> 00:16:37.520 line:0%
can stand against us?

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:39.880 line:0%
I, Shen Du, am a man of integrity.

00:16:41.070 --> 00:16:44.070 line:0%
Being mentioned in the same breath as someone like you

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:46.720 line:0%
is a disgrace to me.

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:53.360 line:0%
You don't want to?

00:16:55.270 --> 00:16:56.590 line:0%
The world says

00:16:57.280 --> 00:16:58.080 line:0%
you and I

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:01.210 line:0%
are the Grand Empress Dowager's two most trusted aides.

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:02.720 line:0%
But do you know

00:17:03.280 --> 00:17:04.360 line:0%
that she has long suspected

00:17:04.360 --> 00:17:06.520 line:0%
that we have ulterior motives?

00:17:06.869 --> 00:17:08.800 line:0%
She made us watch each other

00:17:08.800 --> 00:17:10.360 line:0%
and turn against each other,

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:11.149 line:0%
while she

00:17:11.560 --> 00:17:13.560 line:0%
sat back and reaped the benefits.

00:17:15.909 --> 00:17:17.960 line:0%
After all, she is

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:21.250 line:0%
the most terrifying woman in this world.

00:17:23.649 --> 00:17:26.149 line:0%
Everyone is within her grasp—

00:17:28.280 --> 00:17:29.200 line:0%
you,

00:17:31.130 --> 00:17:32.050 line:0%
me,

00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:35.760 line:0%
and the Shen family

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:39.160 line:0%
of the past.

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:48.220 line:0%
Has no one ever told you that the downfall

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:51.390 line:0%
of the Shen family back then

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:54.930 line:0%
was orchestrated by the Grand Empress Dowager herself?

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:03.920 line:0%
And you,

00:18:04.840 --> 00:18:06.500 line:0%
you fool,

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:07.720 line:0%
have spent all these years kneeling

00:18:07.720 --> 00:18:09.320 line:0%
on the blood of the dozens of Shen family members,

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:10.280 line:0%
serving their true murderer

00:18:10.280 --> 00:18:12.150 line:0%
like a loyal dog.

00:18:16.560 --> 00:18:17.780 line:0%
Do you have evidence?

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:20.270 line:0%
Evidence?

00:18:23.170 --> 00:18:25.120 line:0%
Stop deceiving yourself.

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:27.970 line:0%
I guess that after all these years,

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:30.230 line:0%
you must have realized it to some extent.

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:32.690 line:0%
In Shen Bingzhu's

00:18:32.720 --> 00:18:34.320 line:0%
treason case back then,

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:37.580 line:0%
many people kicked him

00:18:37.610 --> 00:18:38.770 line:0%
when he was down.

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:39.710 line:0%
Why?

00:18:42.280 --> 00:18:43.960 line:0%
Because everyone knew that it was

00:18:43.960 --> 00:18:46.700 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager who wanted him dead.

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:52.680 line:0%
Dozens of lives,

00:18:53.740 --> 00:18:55.270 line:0%
not a single one left alive—

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:59.120 line:0%
only one lapdog was spared.

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:13.580 line:0%
Nonsense!

00:19:13.890 --> 00:19:15.200 line:0%
Nonsense!

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:18.360 line:0%
Nonsense!

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:43.130 line:0%
Yes.

00:19:44.190 --> 00:19:45.430 line:0%
You saw it.

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:47.120 line:0%
I'm the fire moth.

00:19:47.170 --> 00:19:48.400 line:0%
I am the true master

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:49.790 line:0%
of the Fire Moth Sect.

00:19:50.510 --> 00:19:51.690 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:55.750 line:0%
you've witnessed the power of the Fire Moth Sect.

00:19:56.230 --> 00:19:57.630 line:0%
Why not join me

00:19:58.200 --> 00:19:59.680 line:0%
in the great cause?

00:20:59.600 --> 00:21:04.140 line:0%
[I, Yan Xing, junior sixth-rank Director of the Ministry of Justice, hereby accuse the sycophant official, Lai, of abusing his power.]

00:21:37.280 --> 00:21:38.940 line:0%
[Hold Fast to the Golden Mean]

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:42.880 line:0%
-Madam.
-Madam.

00:21:43.220 --> 00:21:48.800 line:0%
[Peace and Prosperity]

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:48.630 line:0%
Madam,

00:21:49.560 --> 00:21:51.000 line:0%
Xiang'an City is now

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:53.680 line:0%
under Lai Luozhi's control.

00:21:54.880 --> 00:21:56.720 line:0%
Many officials who opposed him

00:21:56.720 --> 00:21:58.120 line:0%
have been assassinated.

00:21:58.160 --> 00:21:59.900 line:0%
You must be extremely careful

00:22:00.160 --> 00:22:02.660 line:0%
on the way this time.

00:22:02.740 --> 00:22:03.910 line:0%
Butler Shen,

00:22:04.890 --> 00:22:07.160 line:0%
no matter how many difficulties I will encounter

00:22:07.160 --> 00:22:08.360 line:0%
on my way there today,

00:22:09.110 --> 00:22:10.480 line:0%
I will not back down.

00:22:11.760 --> 00:22:13.590 line:0%
What happened to the Shen family back then

00:22:13.590 --> 00:22:14.790 line:0%
will not be repeated.

00:22:19.090 --> 00:22:20.210 line:0%
I, Yan Xing,

00:22:20.590 --> 00:22:21.790 line:0%
must enter the palace

00:22:21.850 --> 00:22:24.580 line:0%
and seek justice from the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:22:30.170 --> 00:22:31.560 line:0%
Remember to leave the door open for me.

00:22:31.560 --> 00:22:32.360 line:0%
Yes.

00:22:40.930 --> 00:22:43.360 line:0%
-Madam.
-Madam.

00:23:00.160 --> 00:23:01.480 line:0%
Yan Xing, be smart

00:23:01.480 --> 00:23:02.740 line:0%
and stop moving forward!

00:23:02.740 --> 00:23:04.020 line:0%
What if I refuse?

00:23:04.400 --> 00:23:05.520 line:0%
Are you planning

00:23:05.560 --> 00:23:06.440 line:0%
to continue assassinating

00:23:06.440 --> 00:23:07.920 line:0%
imperial officials on the street?

00:23:07.920 --> 00:23:09.320 line:0%
Is there no law anymore?

00:23:17.760 --> 00:23:18.830 line:0%
Are you alright?

00:23:21.600 --> 00:23:22.400 line:0%
Sixth Lady,

00:23:22.580 --> 00:23:23.780 line:0%
do what you want to do.

00:23:24.480 --> 00:23:25.520 line:0%
Stupid Yan Xing,

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:27.080 line:0%
hurry up if you want to save your man.

00:23:27.080 --> 00:23:27.880 line:0%
Thank you.

00:23:28.240 --> 00:23:29.040 line:0%
Let's go.

00:23:37.100 --> 00:23:41.140 line:0%
[Zichen Hall]

00:23:37.800 --> 00:23:40.280 line:0%
I, Yan Xing, junior sixth-rank Director

00:23:40.280 --> 00:23:41.880 line:0%
of the Ministry of Justice,

00:23:42.440 --> 00:23:44.780 line:0%
hereby accuse the sycophant official, Lai,

00:23:44.780 --> 00:23:46.640 line:0%
of abusing his power and authority,

00:23:46.640 --> 00:23:48.250 line:0%
distorting the truth,

00:23:48.440 --> 00:23:51.400 line:0%
and wrongfully accusing Shen Du, the Grand Commander of the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:23:51.400 --> 00:23:53.000 line:0%
Shen Du, the Grand Commander,

00:23:53.000 --> 00:23:55.730 line:0%
is loyal and devoted, with heaven as his witness.

00:23:55.740 --> 00:23:59.380 line:0%
Please, Grand Empress Dowager, restore Shen Du's innocence!

00:24:10.000 --> 00:24:13.040 line:0%
I, Yan Xing, junior sixth-rank Director

00:24:10.310 --> 00:24:13.620 line:0%
[Zichen Hall]

00:24:13.160 --> 00:24:14.980 line:0%
of the Ministry of Justice,

00:24:15.080 --> 00:24:17.280 line:0%
hereby accuse the sycophant official, Lai,

00:24:17.280 --> 00:24:18.740 line:0%
of abusing his power and authority

00:24:17.460 --> 00:24:19.500 line:0%
♫The clash of gold and iron shatters the world♫

00:24:17.820 --> 00:24:21.300 line:0%
[Zichen Hall]

00:24:19.000 --> 00:24:20.280 line:0%
and distorting the truth!

00:24:20.180 --> 00:24:22.420 line:0%
♫Together, we advance and retreat side by side♫

00:24:20.800 --> 00:24:22.460 line:0%
Shen Du, the Grand Commander,

00:24:22.520 --> 00:24:25.820 line:0%
is loyal and devoted, with heaven as his witness.

00:24:23.600 --> 00:24:25.250 line:0%
♫The vast world stands proud, without regret♫

00:24:26.000 --> 00:24:28.000 line:0%
Please, Grand Empress Dowager, restore Shen Du's innocence!

00:24:26.140 --> 00:24:29.210 line:0%
♫We stand firmly against the forces of evil♫

00:24:28.000 --> 00:24:29.820 line:0%
Her Majesty is not seeing anyone now.

00:24:29.820 --> 00:24:32.460 line:0%
♫In dreams, a hundred turns unfold♫

00:24:32.600 --> 00:24:33.560 line:0%
Go back.

00:24:33.060 --> 00:24:35.100 line:0%
♫Destiny binds us, walking together through life♫

00:24:36.450 --> 00:24:38.020 line:0%
♫Unforgettable, the brief encounter♫

00:24:39.150 --> 00:24:40.860 line:0%
♫Like petals flying in the wind♫

00:24:39.770 --> 00:24:41.380 line:0%
Everything is predestined.

00:24:41.170 --> 00:24:44.600 line:0%
♫Through thick and thin, unwavering in heart♫

00:24:41.590 --> 00:24:43.010 line:0%
It's meaningless.

00:24:43.910 --> 00:24:46.810 line:0%
[Zichen Hall]

00:24:45.590 --> 00:24:46.930 line:0%
♫I'll be with you forever♫

00:24:47.800 --> 00:24:52.020 line:0%
♫At least I have you to share both joy and sorrow♫

00:24:49.650 --> 00:24:52.920 line:0%
I, Yan Xing, junior sixth-rank Director

00:24:53.000 --> 00:24:54.990 line:0%
of the Ministry of Justice,

00:24:53.940 --> 00:24:57.010 line:0%
♫Unravel fate, fearless and unyielding♫

00:24:55.400 --> 00:24:57.860 line:0%
hereby accuse the sycophant official, Lai,

00:24:58.140 --> 00:25:02.000 line:0%
[Zichen Hall]

00:24:58.280 --> 00:24:59.890 line:0%
of abusing his power and authority

00:24:58.420 --> 00:24:59.770 line:0%
♫A dream brings me back♫

00:25:00.320 --> 00:25:01.800 line:0%
and distorting the truth!

00:25:00.740 --> 00:25:05.090 line:0%
♫The scenery is bright, hand in hand, we go back together♫

00:25:06.450 --> 00:25:09.790 line:0%
♫Through thick and thin, unwavering in heart♫

00:25:10.550 --> 00:25:12.390 line:0%
♫I'll be with you forever♫

00:25:13.140 --> 00:25:17.440 line:0%
♫At least I have you to share both joy and sorrow♫

00:25:19.290 --> 00:25:22.440 line:0%
♫Unravel fate, fearless and unyielding♫

00:25:23.580 --> 00:25:25.470 line:0%
♫A dream brings me back♫

00:25:26.030 --> 00:25:30.810 line:0%
♫The scenery is bright, hand in hand, we go back together♫

00:25:29.890 --> 00:25:31.710 line:0%
Please, Grand Empress Dowager,

00:25:32.260 --> 00:25:38.390 line:0%
♫In this life, my heart remains untainted by dust or ash♫

00:25:33.130 --> 00:25:35.340 line:0%
restore Shen Du's innocence!

00:25:54.600 --> 00:25:55.400 line:0%
Commander Xu,

00:25:55.640 --> 00:25:56.640 line:0%
Do you think I

00:25:56.640 --> 00:25:58.770 line:0%
can be considered a female hero today?

00:25:59.880 --> 00:26:00.400 line:0%
Yes,

00:26:00.680 --> 00:26:01.680 line:0%
of course you can.

00:26:02.810 --> 00:26:04.010 line:0%
Why are you laughing?

00:26:04.900 --> 00:26:07.140 line:0%
I'm just wondering how a girl like you

00:26:07.600 --> 00:26:09.260 line:0%
could want to be a female hero.

00:26:10.640 --> 00:26:12.530 line:0%
Because only a female hero

00:26:12.800 --> 00:26:14.600 line:0%
is worthy of a great hero.

00:26:23.420 --> 00:26:24.180 line:0%
Oh, right,

00:26:24.340 --> 00:26:26.070 line:0%
how's your dowry coming along?

00:26:27.470 --> 00:26:29.600 line:0%
You've been a Constable Marshal for so many years.

00:26:29.600 --> 00:26:30.360 line:0%
Don't tell me you haven't saved

00:26:30.360 --> 00:26:31.600 line:0%
anything at all.

00:26:35.300 --> 00:26:36.900 line:0%
Once this matter is settled,

00:26:37.160 --> 00:26:38.240 line:0%
I'll definitely give you

00:26:38.240 --> 00:26:39.280 line:0%
a grand wedding,

00:26:39.520 --> 00:26:40.880 line:0%
with constables from all over the world

00:26:40.880 --> 00:26:42.000 line:0%
coming to celebrate.

00:26:42.000 --> 00:26:43.600 line:0%
You'll have a glorious wedding.

00:26:43.600 --> 00:26:44.400 line:0%
Really?

00:26:44.480 --> 00:26:45.280 line:0%
Of course.

00:26:54.840 --> 00:26:55.640 line:0%
Those are distress fireworks

00:26:55.640 --> 00:26:56.560 line:0%
from our constable brothers.

00:26:56.560 --> 00:26:57.820 line:0%
It's outside the city.

00:27:50.160 --> 00:27:50.960 line:0%
Commander Xu.

00:27:51.520 --> 00:27:52.450 line:0%
Don't be afraid.

00:28:00.000 --> 00:28:01.480 line:0%
You lowly scoundrels,

00:28:01.480 --> 00:28:04.010 line:0%
-don't even think about hurting me!
-Yun Que.

00:28:04.810 --> 00:28:05.890 line:0%
Follow my orders.

00:28:06.360 --> 00:28:06.840 line:0%
Run!

00:28:06.960 --> 00:28:07.720 line:0%
Run?

00:28:08.060 --> 00:28:08.500 line:0%
Yes.

00:28:08.880 --> 00:28:10.200 line:0%
Go back to the city, find Jiang Langxing,

00:28:10.200 --> 00:28:12.120 line:0%
and ask him to take the constables out of the city to provide support.

00:28:12.120 --> 00:28:14.450 line:0%
This is an order from a Constable Marshal,

00:28:15.000 --> 00:28:16.600 line:0%
and it must not be disobeyed.

00:28:18.040 --> 00:28:18.840 line:0%
Yes.

00:28:57.440 --> 00:28:57.960 line:0%
Wait.

00:28:58.170 --> 00:28:59.160 line:0%
Xu was not asking me

00:28:59.160 --> 00:29:00.370 line:0%
to find reinforcements.

00:29:00.370 --> 00:29:01.900 line:0%
He knew it would be too late.

00:29:08.770 --> 00:29:11.230 line:0%
He was trying to cover for me to escape alone.

00:29:36.150 --> 00:29:37.360 line:0%
Xu!

00:30:16.310 --> 00:30:17.600 line:0%
Yun Que...

00:30:21.710 --> 00:30:23.220 line:0%
I'm afraid...

00:30:25.430 --> 00:30:28.050 line:0%
I'll have to break the promise...

00:30:29.610 --> 00:30:33.270 line:0%
of the glorious wedding I made to you.

00:30:34.920 --> 00:30:36.200 line:0%
What did you call me?

00:30:49.380 --> 00:30:55.250 line:0%
♫I hope you also look up and see the radiant stars and moon♫

00:30:54.480 --> 00:30:55.320 line:0%
My...

00:30:59.700 --> 00:31:05.380 line:0%
♫No matter how vast the world is, I'll wait for your appearance♫

00:31:02.790 --> 00:31:03.810 line:0%
wife...

00:31:08.310 --> 00:31:11.870 line:0%
♫A quick glance at each other♫

00:31:12.660 --> 00:31:17.120 line:0%
♫Has warmed the winter in memories♫

00:31:18.470 --> 00:31:25.230 line:0%
♫Don't mind the destined solitude, and shine brightly♫

00:31:28.150 --> 00:31:31.510 line:0%
♫I'll wait until the years blossom like flowers♫

00:31:32.430 --> 00:31:36.260 line:0%
♫The ice and snow slowly melted♫

00:31:38.280 --> 00:31:41.940 line:0%
♫I heard those tender words♫

00:31:40.540 --> 00:31:52.020 line:0%
My husband, let's go home together.

00:31:42.610 --> 00:31:46.730 line:0%
♫He told her, "I love you"♫

00:31:48.800 --> 00:31:51.740 line:0%
♫What I saw in my dreams♫

00:31:52.830 --> 00:31:56.840 line:0%
♫Is not a flashy illusion♫

00:31:57.870 --> 00:32:02.470 line:0%
♫I don't fear the challenges ahead, riding a white horse to chase after time♫

00:32:03.170 --> 00:32:06.550 line:0%
♫Let's go together♫

00:32:08.320 --> 00:32:12.230 line:0%
♫Love is pure and flawless, indifferent to the changes of the world♫

00:32:12.740 --> 00:32:16.370 line:0%
♫Let's experience it together♫

00:32:21.560 --> 00:32:22.280 line:0%
Good.

00:32:24.160 --> 00:32:25.620 line:0%
Now, the power in the court

00:32:25.680 --> 00:32:27.520 line:0%
is fully in my hands.

00:32:28.600 --> 00:32:29.440 line:0%
Only these constables

00:32:29.440 --> 00:32:31.430 line:0%
who are oblivious to the current situation

00:32:31.430 --> 00:32:33.310 line:0%
are so hard to control.

00:32:34.880 --> 00:32:37.190 line:0%
The remaining pedantic scholars

00:32:37.280 --> 00:32:38.940 line:0%
are much easier to intimidate

00:32:39.120 --> 00:32:40.480 line:0%
than these ruffians.

00:32:40.680 --> 00:32:42.600 line:0%
Now that the constables are without a leader,

00:32:42.600 --> 00:32:44.320 line:0%
they can't amount to much.

00:32:45.760 --> 00:32:47.960 line:0%
Now that the Constable Marshal is dead,

00:32:48.640 --> 00:32:51.570 line:0%
the Grand Commander of the Imperial Security Bureau

00:32:51.600 --> 00:32:53.680 line:0%
should face reality.

00:33:13.200 --> 00:33:14.720 line:0%
Why did you bring me here?

00:33:14.960 --> 00:33:16.160 line:0%
On this winter night,

00:33:16.800 --> 00:33:18.240 line:0%
I brought you here

00:33:19.000 --> 00:33:21.060 line:0%
to enjoy a different kind of scenery.

00:34:56.720 --> 00:34:57.840 line:0%
If I didn't know

00:34:58.320 --> 00:34:59.400 line:0%
that Yan Xing is a spy sent by Prime Minister Zhang

00:34:59.400 --> 00:35:01.120 line:0%
to your side,

00:35:02.240 --> 00:35:03.040 line:0%
I might actually

00:35:03.040 --> 00:35:04.480 line:0%
feel some sympathy

00:35:05.080 --> 00:35:07.280 line:0%
for the deep affection between you two.

00:35:08.830 --> 00:35:10.080 line:0%
Today, for you,

00:35:10.720 --> 00:35:11.880 line:0%
your wife boldly

00:35:12.120 --> 00:35:13.640 line:0%
stormed into the palace

00:35:14.160 --> 00:35:15.400 line:0%
and knelt in the snow

00:35:15.520 --> 00:35:17.040 line:0%
for the entire day.

00:35:22.480 --> 00:35:25.740 line:0%
Lord Lai, you didn't bring me here in the middle of the night

00:35:28.320 --> 00:35:30.560 line:0%
just to watch my wife with me, did you?

00:35:31.600 --> 00:35:33.000 line:0%
I am jealous of you.

00:35:34.160 --> 00:35:35.240 line:0%
Why are there always so many people

00:35:35.240 --> 00:35:37.570 line:0%
willing to sacrifice themselves for you?

00:35:42.080 --> 00:35:43.740 line:0%
You probably don't know this,

00:35:44.720 --> 00:35:46.920 line:0%
but in order to get your wife into the palace,

00:35:46.920 --> 00:35:48.720 line:0%
Constable Marshal and his woman

00:35:49.320 --> 00:35:50.800 line:0%
even gave up their lives.

00:35:53.680 --> 00:35:54.880 line:0%
How pitiful,

00:35:55.840 --> 00:35:56.970 line:0%
and how lamentable.

00:36:01.200 --> 00:36:02.460 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen,

00:36:03.920 --> 00:36:05.650 line:0%
I'm sure that after these days,

00:36:06.600 --> 00:36:08.480 line:0%
you should have some idea

00:36:09.880 --> 00:36:10.800 line:0%
of how

00:36:11.640 --> 00:36:14.370 line:0%
the future situation of the world will be, right?

00:36:18.480 --> 00:36:20.610 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen, do you remember

00:36:20.920 --> 00:36:21.720 line:0%
that when I gave you

00:36:21.720 --> 00:36:23.380 line:0%
that bottle of heart's blood,

00:36:25.760 --> 00:36:27.820 line:0%
you promised me something in return?

00:36:37.760 --> 00:36:40.120 line:0%
Whether you were sincere or not,

00:36:40.880 --> 00:36:43.200 line:0%
I need you to stand by my side.

00:36:45.800 --> 00:36:46.600 line:0%
Of course.

00:36:46.680 --> 00:36:47.640 line:0%
That's good.

00:36:48.520 --> 00:36:49.920 line:0%
I have always believed

00:36:50.450 --> 00:36:51.520 line:0%
that Shen Du

00:36:52.200 --> 00:36:54.240 line:0%
is not a man who would break his word.

00:37:38.400 --> 00:37:39.200 line:0%
Madam.

00:37:42.920 --> 00:37:44.480 line:0%
It was just a little snow.

00:37:46.680 --> 00:37:47.640 line:0%
It's a pity

00:37:49.520 --> 00:37:52.650 line:0%
that I didn't get to see the Grand Empress Dowager today.

00:37:55.640 --> 00:37:56.970 line:0%
I will go again tomorrow

00:37:57.160 --> 00:37:58.560 line:0%
to beg to see her.

00:38:15.190 --> 00:38:15.990 line:0%
Shen Du...

00:38:26.160 --> 00:38:27.160 line:0%
You're back.

00:38:27.700 --> 00:38:28.560 line:0%
Was it the Grand Empress Dowager

00:38:28.560 --> 00:38:29.720 line:0%
who let you return?

00:38:32.200 --> 00:38:33.160 line:0%
It was Lord Lai.

00:38:38.780 --> 00:38:39.820 line:0%
Lord Lai?

00:38:41.600 --> 00:38:43.600 line:0%
Lai Luozhi actually let you return?

00:38:45.200 --> 00:38:46.760 line:0%
He actually showed mercy?

00:38:49.120 --> 00:38:50.160 line:0%
What happened to your face?

00:38:50.160 --> 00:38:50.920 line:0%
Let me see.

00:39:12.360 --> 00:39:13.160 line:0%
Honey,

00:39:13.880 --> 00:39:14.960 line:0%
what's wrong?

00:39:16.720 --> 00:39:17.520 line:0%
Yan Xing,

00:39:19.840 --> 00:39:21.000 line:0%
let's divorce.

00:39:30.780 --> 00:39:31.900 line:0%
What did you say?

00:39:35.360 --> 00:39:36.160 line:0%
Let's...

00:39:38.400 --> 00:39:39.200 line:0%
divorce.

00:39:43.290 --> 00:39:44.120 line:0%
Divorce?

00:39:46.300 --> 00:39:47.140 line:0%
Why?

00:39:50.760 --> 00:39:51.400 line:0%
Are you

00:39:51.400 --> 00:39:52.720 line:0%
in some kind of danger?

00:39:53.940 --> 00:39:54.880 line:0%
Did Lai Luozhi

00:39:54.880 --> 00:39:56.080 line:0%
force you into this?

00:39:59.530 --> 00:40:01.370 line:0%
What exactly happened?

00:40:07.520 --> 00:40:09.210 line:0%
Shen Du, have you forgotten?

00:40:10.560 --> 00:40:12.160 line:0%
I am Yan Xing,

00:40:15.160 --> 00:40:17.420 line:0%
the Director in the Ministry of Justice.

00:40:18.380 --> 00:40:19.980 line:0%
Although my rank is not high,

00:40:20.640 --> 00:40:21.520 line:0%
I am a female official of the court

00:40:21.520 --> 00:40:22.200 line:0%
who has handled

00:40:22.200 --> 00:40:23.280 line:0%
many major cases.

00:40:26.570 --> 00:40:27.610 line:0%
I have never been

00:40:27.640 --> 00:40:29.160 line:0%
a delicate flower that needs

00:40:29.160 --> 00:40:31.360 line:0%
to rely on my husband for protection.

00:40:31.610 --> 00:40:33.540 line:0%
I am like solid mountains and trees

00:40:33.880 --> 00:40:35.320 line:0%
that can stand by your side and weather the storm

00:40:35.320 --> 00:40:36.440 line:0%
with you.

00:40:38.820 --> 00:40:40.360 line:0%
I am not afraid of trouble,

00:40:40.360 --> 00:40:41.830 line:0%
not afraid of difficulties.

00:40:41.830 --> 00:40:43.280 line:0%
No matter what happened,

00:40:43.280 --> 00:40:44.000 line:0%
I can face it

00:40:44.000 --> 00:40:45.320 line:0%
with you.

00:40:52.930 --> 00:40:55.330 line:0%
Are you afraid of involving the Yan family?

00:40:57.670 --> 00:40:58.620 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:41:00.330 --> 00:41:01.320 line:0%
if Lai Luozhi

00:41:01.320 --> 00:41:03.120 line:0%
is determined to target us,

00:41:03.700 --> 00:41:05.400 line:0%
even if we divorce,

00:41:05.800 --> 00:41:07.640 line:0%
he will not let the Yan family go.

00:41:09.240 --> 00:41:10.880 line:0%
If we want to protect them,

00:41:12.240 --> 00:41:14.100 line:0%
we should think of a way together,

00:41:14.240 --> 00:41:15.040 line:0%
like...

00:41:16.570 --> 00:41:17.600 line:0%
sending the Yan family away

00:41:17.600 --> 00:41:18.840 line:0%
from Xiang'an to avoid disaster,

00:41:18.840 --> 00:41:19.560 line:0%
or...

00:41:23.890 --> 00:41:24.860 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:41:28.760 --> 00:41:30.690 line:0%
It's not because of the Yan family,

00:41:31.640 --> 00:41:33.320 line:0%
and no one has threatened me.

00:41:34.010 --> 00:41:36.010 line:0%
The reason is actually very simple.

00:41:37.360 --> 00:41:39.090 line:0%
After going through this time,

00:41:40.000 --> 00:41:41.460 line:0%
I've realized something.

00:41:42.180 --> 00:41:43.560 line:0%
The Shen family has weathered many storms.

00:41:43.560 --> 00:41:46.690 line:0%
What it needs is a madam who is well-educated, virtuous,

00:41:47.120 --> 00:41:50.850 line:0%
and capable of supporting her husband and educating her children.

00:41:51.160 --> 00:41:52.360 line:0%
You cannot provide me

00:41:52.360 --> 00:41:54.290 line:0%
with a peaceful, worry-free home,

00:41:55.290 --> 00:41:57.460 line:0%
nor do you understand how to put your husband first.

00:41:57.460 --> 00:41:59.160 line:0%
You are competitive in everything,

00:41:59.160 --> 00:42:00.820 line:0%
loving to be in the spotlight.

00:42:02.370 --> 00:42:03.400 line:0%
You are not the ideal partner

00:42:03.400 --> 00:42:04.920 line:0%
to spend the rest of my life with.